WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:02.860
JULY 9TH

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.330
LIFE THEATER

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.870
I blew it again.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.630
That was my 17,711th attempt!

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.340
Won't leave

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:27.140
Without a dropkick on her

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.230
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:48.290
-She summoned me, the evil god
-Evil god

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.790
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.710
-I can't go back to hell
-Sister...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.420
Yeah, yeah, yeah
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.300
If you go too far

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:02.300
I'll slice you up completely

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.590
Your halo
Must get it back

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.720
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:13.020
-To attack her from behind
-You're so mean

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:17.150
I'll never give up

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.820
Yurine, you're off your guard!

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:22.990
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.910
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.330
Can't leave Earth

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:34.370
Without a dropkick on her

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.630
But until then

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:43.550
-Let's all have fun together
-Yeah!

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.760
Medusa!

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:55.690
What is it, Jashin-chan?
You look so serious.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.400
-We're going to the bank.
-What?

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.610
No, resist that urge! Don't rob the bank!

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:02.070
Please don't!

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.150
Chill out. We're just withdrawing your money.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.160
Oh, you got me there.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:08.820
Well, the slots got me.

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:11.540
-I'm so relieved.
-Don't be.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:13.950
My actions rewrite history.

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.370
This is the last time.

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.540
Now, let's get going to the bank.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:33.060
How the hell did we end up
in the middle of a bank robbery?

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:34.810
Don't make a sound!

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.770
Don't get smart with us.

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.020
I should have sent you here alone.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.400
I never signed up for this!

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:46.820
You! Viper girl, cut the whining or I'll kill you.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:51.280
I don't care what happens to her,
just spare my life, won't you?

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.700
How could you!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.790
Another word and you're both dead.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.620
Mom, I wanna play cards.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.290
-Quiet, not now.
-This sucks.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:07.010
Jashin-chan, do you think your dropkick
could take these humans out?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.050
You're a devil, you should punish them.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:13.310
But if I miss, they'd kill me.
Why risk my life?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.930
Even devils aren't immune
to a bullet in the head.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.600
But you have to protect everyone!

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:23.270
Mom, I'm starving.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.820
Hang in there.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.610
I'm supposed to take my meds right now.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.320
I can't let my pet chick starve to death.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:33.490
I can't afford to miss today's business meeting.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:37.540
I'm missing out on Miyutan's handshake event.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.370
Guess I'm late for work.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.380
-Baby coming...
-I'm going to pee my pants!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.130
Fine, all right.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:47.630
Jashin-chan!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.340
If you're so inclined, go for it.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.890
I'll be an innocent bystander who lives.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.640
I should look for another gig.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:02.230
-Baby...
-I need those meds to stay thin.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.360
-This is horrible!
-My poor chick!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.360
You're really going for it?

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:08.030
Yes.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:11.700
-Are we done?
-No, not yet.

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.490
Hey, move again and you're dead.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.160
What's with the paper bag?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.620
Excuse me, would you please
take a look at my eyes?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.630
Hey, she's pretty cute!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.380
Well done.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.550
Everyone, we're safe now.

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:39.520
-What just happened?
-No idea, but we're safe now!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.390
She looks like Miyutan!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.270
-Thank you.
-Paper bag girl!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.440
Thanks.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.480
The baby's born, I'm ecstatic.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.280
I couldn't hold it.
It's all lukewarm for me.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:53.950
My dropkick would've been just as effective,
you know.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:57.080
But I'll let Medusa take all the credit here.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.090
Orochimaru! That was quite a feat!

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:10.960
Oh, that was nothing, really.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.380
Couldn't do it without my partner, Medusa.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.890
Hey, paper bag girl.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.220
When will they de-fossilize?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.350
Oh, eventually.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:25.270
-Gotcha! Leave the rest to us!
-Thank you.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:27.400
Let's go, Orochimaru.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.270
-Where?
-Oh, come on.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:32.280
I'm gonna make you mine today.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.900
-You're under arrest!
-No way in hell!

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:37.910
-Medusa, help!
-Not my problem.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.660
Bank robber arrest victory!
Now that's Insta-worthy.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:44.160
Hashtag "no money stolen."

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.620
Hashtag "but my heart was."

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.670
Hashtag "I love Orochimaru."

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:53.300
I need you! ATM!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.550
You're on your own, deceiver.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.930
The ATMs are over there.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.470
What? You traitor!

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.520
I should've known!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:07.980
The number of bank robberies
in Japan peaked in 2001.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.320
Since then, they have decreased.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:14.940
Instead, low-risk crimes like bank transfer scams
have sky-rocketed.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:20.410
Don't be a victim.
Check-in with your parents frequently.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.700
But history's changed now!

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:26.960
My bag ripped.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.170
Use this.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.920
Thanks, that's good for now.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:36.720
But nothing tops craft paper bags
when it comes to comfort, texture and smell.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.050
Never knew you were so particular.

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.940
It's a new day!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.860
Time to deliver the milk!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:06:59.740
MILK

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:02.700
There! That's it for today.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:07.120
Sweet. I was a second faster than last time!

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:12.250
At this rate, I'll eventually make
a zero-second record!

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.000
Oh, I wish!

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.670
Seconds, please!

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:21.640
-You've got quite the appetite.
-She's got no shame.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.760
You're just a great cook, Jashin-chan.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.390
I know. No need to say it.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:29.770
Here you go.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.270
Just like the folktales.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.570
Like this one.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.530
Where does that energy come from?

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.900
Never caught a cold as a child either.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.910
They do say that fools never catch colds.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.450
I've never caught a cold either.

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.160
Because I'm a fool.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.910
Are you okay on time?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.920
Shoot, I'm gonna be late.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:54.670
Thanks for breakfast! See you!

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.710
Minos works so hard.

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.380
The complete opposite of someone I know.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.680
I'm a devoted homemaker.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.430
Here we go.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.810
We're glad to have you here.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.600
You can count on me.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:14.230
-It's so heavy...
-Hey, little one!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.730
Me?

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:18.940
Yeah, you! Little one! I'm talking to you.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.700
You're moving too slow.
Wake up, will you?

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:25.870
Why do I have to be treated like a slave
in order to survive?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.700
Leave the heavy-lifting to me.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.580
Go get assigned another task.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.370
Thank you so much.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:34.960
No biggie.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.420
She's so bright.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.170
She is a devil, right?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.930
Another busy day of work all done!

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.930
Time to jog back home.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.730
Thanks for--

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:58.900
I couldn't even thank her.
I'm such a loser.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.950
I will next time.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.160
Will I ever get to see Jashin-chan?

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:17.210
-My bad! Are you okay?
-Yes.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.210
Good, I'm glad.

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.340
Get home safe.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.090
See you!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.470
She's a devil!

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:32.480
Wait, do you know Jashin-chan? Hey!

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.230
Hey, Minos!

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.230
-Let's play cards!
-Play with us.

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:42.490
Sorry, kiddos, I don't have my cards with me.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.240
Really?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:45.490
That's a bummer.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.530
-Next time, I promise!
-Okay, see you!

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.580
-Bye!
-See you later!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.000
Hey, kiddos...

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:58.330
I've got cards we could play with,
what do you say?

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.380
No, we're good.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.720
-Let's go, guys.
-Yeah.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.390
-We wanted Minos.
-She's got big boobs.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:13.270
-Minos is really good, too.
-She's got big boobs, too.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.520
What a day today!

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:26.740
Taking a bath after a hard day's work
is the best feeling ever.

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:28.740
Yeah!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.750
Delicious!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.420
I'm ready to do it all again tomorrow!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:47.300
We're both devils, but why is Minos
more popular with humans? Damn it!

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:49.590
You're better off extinct, humans!

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:52.680
With that attitude, it's no surprise.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:55.770
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.940
What do you wanna drink?

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.650
-Orange or grapefruit?
-Orange.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:02.820
All right.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.280
-Here you go.
-That was kind of gross.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.830
Jashin-chan.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:17.330
How does ramen for lunch sound?

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.080
I'm in the mood for rice.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.920
You look like you're lusting for ramen.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.130
But I just said--

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.720
You want ramen, right?

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:30.970
Yes, I'd love to eat ramen.

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.430
Here we go again.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.220
Welcome!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.480
-Hey you!
-Damn it.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.650
-You know her?
-She almost killed me!

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:46.610
-I'll finish you today!
-Please stop, I don't know you!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.690
-You can't fool me!
-Stop!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:51.950
-Don't hurt Noelle!
-Step away!

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.910
What? Noelle?
That's not your name.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:00.710
Noelle is a future idol
who works here to support herself!

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.290
A sweet girl like her would never kill!

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.000
An idol?

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.010
They look alike,
but I guess she's not Poporon.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:09.760
Die!

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.510
You're Noelle?

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:15.850
Jeez, what a drag.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.560
Yes, I'm Noelle Amatsuka.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:20.770
Pleasure to meet you!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:27.480
Believe it or not, the ramen and fried rice
killer combo originated in Jinbocho.

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.360
What would you like today?

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:34.700
Enough with the nonsense.
Hurry up and order.

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:36.200
That was close.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.290
Coming right up!

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:41.960
I see you hired new staff
since the last time I was here.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:45.420
Yup, Noelle has spiked the traffic here.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.260
-We come here every day.
-Yup!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.470
Thanks for your support!

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:55.600
Today, I'll treat you to stir-fry sprouts
and take it out of my pay.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:01.980
She's treating us pigs,
using her precious salary!

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.060
Thank you so much.
I'm so happy!

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.110
Losers.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:10.570
Human men get way too excited over nothing.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:16.820
That weird pouch.
That has to be Poporon's.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.450
Let's test her.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.580
Poporon, could I have a refill please?

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.330
Right away!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.080
Damn it!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.170
So you are Poporon!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:32.840
-Stop it! Viper bitch!
-Don't touch our Noelle!

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:37.800
Jashin-chan, this is a place
for all of us to sit down and eat.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.310
There's no exception, Jashin-chan.

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:42.480
But she--

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.190
Don't point.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:52.400
Mito Komon is said to be
the first to have ramen in Japan.

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:56.700
But another theory suggests it was
a monk during the Muromachi Period.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.950
What you believe is up to you.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.370
Check please.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.750
Okay.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.540
That was very good.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.340
-I'm sorry for all the ruckus.
-Yeah...

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:12.760
We're leaving, Jashin-chan.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:24.230
As Jashin-chan said, you aren't just a human.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.730
You exert the same aura
as another girl I know.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:34.530
That girl subdued the devil.
She knows who I am, too.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.530
Who the hell is she?

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.660
Dropkick on My Devil!

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.370
Stationery.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:47.620
Since it has "station" in it,
it must be a military-related defensive weapon.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.170
Hey, Yurine.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:52.960
I wanna test my defense powers,
so attack me.

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:54.170
Sure thing.

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:55.880
Now, come at me!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.260
Completely useless.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:04.680
You're such an idiot.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:15.230
I can't suppress this craving for pudding.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.330
There you are.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:35.050
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:40.590
After my first bite of pudding
in the human world,

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:43.010
I was instantly addicted.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.350
To the point where I suffer withdrawal symptoms.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.940
So good! It's too good!

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.860
It permeates through my brain!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:57.820
There are no other sweets
that have this effect on me!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.820
YURINE

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:08.540
Damn it!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.080
This was Yurine's pudding!

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.460
Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:15.840
I need to buy another one
before she gets back!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.880
I'm home.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.180
What's wrong?
Is it the end of the world?

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:26.640
It is for me. Everything was clear
before it all fell apart.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.140
Hey, you ate my pudding.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.060
The invisible one.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:37.360
The invisible one.

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:40.740
Watch out!
There's an invisible one lurking around!

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.070
There's the culprit!

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:46.240
I'm gonna get you!
It just punched me!

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.540
Damn you, invisible one!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.500
Take this! Royal Copenha--

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.630
I won't let you get away with this!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.750
Damn it, it escaped.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.720
I wonder how it escaped
when the window is closed.

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.090
Oh, well...

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.430
That's because...

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:08.350
It went through it?

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.980
How do you see it when it's invisible?

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:14.650
Because... it's from hell?

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.810
I see.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.110
-You have pudding on your lips.
-What?

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.070
Coming.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.240
Delivery!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:29.450
It must be from brawling
with the invisible one just now.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.790
-My order's here.
-Your order?

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.500
What did you order?

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.000
An iron maiden.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.550
If you were honest about it,
you could've just bought another one.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:48.050
But you chose to mock me
with a lame game of charades.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.810
Get me out of here!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.980
You better come out before
you run out of blood.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.070
I don't really have a choice, do I?

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.780
No!

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:32.770
Dropkick on her, yeah her
I'll take you down again

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:37.560
Hate you
Love doesn't exist in this world

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:42.730
Fear the dropkick
An angel looks for her halo

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:47.280
As she starves to death

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.820
It's a love and hate relationship

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:52.120
Can't leave each other alone

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:56.750
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star

00:18:56.960 --> 00:19:00.960
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and die

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:03.380
Test my heart, don't stop

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:10.470
Let's go, dream on
No matter human, angel or devil

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:14.850
We're a happy family

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:18.980
Let me say, I love you

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:21.440
When all is said and done

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:26.030
I'm home
Welcome back, it's hot pot tonight

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:30.780
Come, gather everyone
Let's enjoy this meal

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:33.030
For another crazy tomorrow

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:36.750
What next? What next?
In the end, wake up

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.630
Nobody is out here because of the fog.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:20:00.140
-What the hell was that?
-Jashin-chan, help!

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:04.270
Medusa, what's going--?

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.690
Zombies?

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:18.080
Over here! Medusa, hurry up! Run!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.370
Wait!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.420
It's locked!

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:28.710
Damn it, who would lock it?

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:30.880
Jashin-chan, look!

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.890
Nice find, Medusa.

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:49.780
-Jashin-chan.
-What is it?

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:53.780
Here's some light.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:56.280
Hey, it's too bright.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.120
I'll turn it off so they won't catch us.

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.010
-Let's hide in here.
-Okay.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.060
Come out. Orochimaru.

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:28.190
Orochimaru...

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:54.510
You guys okay in there?

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:56.840
Minos, you saved us!

00:21:57.220 --> 00:22:00.220
It's not safe here.
They're gathered in the back.

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:03.850
-Should we go outside, then?
-That's risky, too.

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:06.600
The fog's too thick to see anything.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.690
Then where should we go?

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:10.610
Come with me.

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:31.880
Run for your life!

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:36.380
-We're doomed!
-Over here!

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:39.340
It's a dead end!

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:42.970
This door is locked, too!

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.020
Please! Someone, open the door!

00:22:47.190 --> 00:22:49.440
Please!

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:53.940
-It's a sliding door.
-Yurine!

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:56.150
Oh, whoops.

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:58.820
-Hurry, Medusa!
-Help!

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:04.410
Hey, don't abandon me! Help!

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:08.290
Medusa! Minos! Save me, please!

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:10.290
Someone please!

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:15.010
Jashin-chan.

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.430
Are you okay?
You were having a nightmare.

00:23:18.680 --> 00:23:20.930
I'm fine.

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:24.060
Please don't scream
in middle of the night.

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:25.890
Okay, I won't.

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:27.060
KONNYAKU

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:34.270
If you place a damp towel on someone's feet
while they're asleep,

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:38.110
they're more prone to nightmares!

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:43.830
The evil preys on the good-hearted.

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:46.790
An angel of sorrow rises up against them.

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:49.540
What does the angel want to protect?

00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:52.000
Dropkick on My Devil!

00:23:52.170 --> 00:23:55.170
Next time, a single-winged angel
will steal your heart!
